:name: Failure paths on the BlackPill F411 model
:description: Firmware that faults on command (u/m/a on USART1); used to show how tests catch failures.
$elf?=$ex_out/fault_demo.elf

using sysbus
mach create "fault"
machine LoadPlatformDescription $ex_dir/../stm32f4_blackpill/blackpill_f411.repl
showAnalyzer usart1
sysbus LoadELF $elf
